   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How are you?",
     "texto": [
      "**Как дела?** = how are you? You answer with **хорошо** (well), **отлично** (great), **нормально** (okay) or **плохо** (bad).",
      "To ask it back: **А у вас?** (and you? formal) or **А у тебя?** (and you? informal)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Speaking a language",
     "texto": [
      "With «speak», Russian does not use the language name directly, but a form that means «in the Russian way»: **по-русски** (in Russian), **по-испански** (in Spanish), **по-английски** (in English).",
      "**Я говорю по-русски** = I speak Russian."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "«Говорить» (to speak)",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Person",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
